OL,3,GNEWSAResidents continue their fight
OL,4,Aagainst data centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of residents are appealing
OL,7,Fafter a controversial #250m
OL,8,Fhigh-security data centre was approved
OL,9,Fby their local council.
OL,11,FThe Neston and Westwells Action Group
OL,12,F[NWAG] says it has launched legal
OL,13,Faction to take Wiltshire Council to the
OL,14,FHigh Court over its decision to approve
OL,15,Fthe facility near Corsham, which
OL,16,Freceived more than 1,000 objections
OL,17,Fbefore it was approved in February.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
