OL,3,GNEWSAResidents continue their fight
OL,4,Aagainst data centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FNWAG spokesperson Morgyn Davies said
OL,7,Fthe development posed a significant
OL,8,Fflood risk and was "projecting itself
OL,9,Fliterally into the heart of a small
OL,10,Fancient Wiltshire village".
OL,12,FA council spokesperson said: "As the
OL,13,Fmatter is subject to legal proceedings,
OL,14,Fit would not be appropriate to comment
OL,15,Ffurther at this stage."
